{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790437605682,"sessionID":"ses_f219cbda4ffeEheE6eTWJKLcmg","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_ab928972c1444454b6ae4125","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Explore project structure","prompt":"Explore the workspace at /workspace thoroughly. I need to understand:\n1. The full directory structure (all files and folders)\n2. The contents of existing files, especially:\n   - res://data/units/unit_stats.gd (or wherever it is)\n   - res://custom_nodes/ (what exists)\n   - res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn\n   - res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd\n   - Any Team enum definition\n   - Any BattleUnit class definition\n3. The project.godot or project configuration file\n\nReturn ALL file contents fully. Be very thorough.","subagent_type":"explore"},"output":"<task id=\"ses_f219c605effe9Pb1K80JAxd1ET\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\nHere is a thorough report of everything found in `/workspace`.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Full Directory Structure\n\n```\n/workspace/\n├── .godot/\n│   ├── .gdignore                              (empty file)\n│   ├── uid_cache.bin                          (binary, unreadable)\n│   ├── scene_groups_cache.cfg\n│   ├── global_script_class_cache.cfg\n│   ├── editor/\n│   │   ├── filesystem_cache10\n│   │   ├── project_metadata.cfg\n│   │   └── main.tscn-folding-3ad5c15c4f3250da0cc7c1af1770d85f.cfg\n│   └── imported/\n│       └── (empty)\n├── custom_nodes/\n│   ├── detect_range.gd.uid\n│   └── target_finder.gd.uid\n├── data/\n│   ├── enemies/\n│   │   └── zombie.tres\n│   └── units/\n│       ├── unit_stats.gd\n│       ├── unit_stats.gd.uid\n│       └── bjorn.tres\n├── scenes/\n│   ├── main.tscn\n│   └── battle_unit/\n│       ├── battle_unit.gd\n│       ├── battle_unit.gd.uid\n│       └── battle_unit.tscn\n├── scripts/\n│   └── (empty directory)\n├── project.godot\n└── task_config.json\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. All File Contents\n\n### `/workspace/project.godot`\n```gdscript\n; Engine configuration file.\n; It's best edited using the editor UI and not directly,\n; since the parameters that go here are not all obvious.\n;\n; Format:\n;   [section] ; section goes between []\n;   param=value ; assign values to parameters\n\nconfig_version=5\n\n[application]\n\nconfig/name=\"Detect Range Target Finder\"\nconfig/description=\"Minimal autobattler targeting task derived from the GodotGameLab combat-preparation tutorial\"\nrun/main_scene=\"res://scenes/main.tscn\"\nconfig/features=PackedStringArray(\"4.4\")\n\n[rendering]\n\nrenderer/rendering_method=\"gl_compatibility\"\n```\n\nKey takeaways:\n- **Godot 4.4** project.\n- **Main scene**: `res://scenes/main.tscn`\n- **Rendering**: GL Compatibility (2D-friendly).\n\n---\n\n### `/workspace/data/units/unit_stats.gd` -- Team enum and UnitStats definition\n```gdscript\nclass_name UnitStats\nextends Resource\n\nenum Team {PLAYER, ENEMY}\n\nconst MAX_ATTACK_RANGE := 5\n\n@export var team: Team\n@export_range(1, MAX_ATTACK_RANGE) var attack_range: int = 1\n```\n\nKey takeaways:\n- **`UnitStats`** is a `Resource` class.\n- **`Team`** enum: `PLAYER = 0`, `ENEMY = 1`.\n- **`MAX_ATTACK_RANGE`** = 5.\n- Exported properties: `team` (Team enum) and `attack_range` (1-5, default 1).\n- **Notable**: The `TARGET` dictionary mentioned in task_config.json does **not** yet exist here.\n\n---\n\n### `/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd` -- BattleUnit class definition\n```gdscript\nclass_name BattleUnit\nextends Area2D\n\n@export var stats: UnitStats: set = _set_stats\n\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tif stats:\n\t\t_set_stats(stats)\n\n\nfunc _set_stats(value: UnitStats) -> void:\n\tstats = value\n\t\n\tif not stats or not is_node_ready():\n\t\treturn\n\t\n\tstats = value.duplicate()\n\tcollision_layer = stats.team + 1\n```\n\nKey takeaways:\n- **`BattleUnit`** extends `Area2D`.\n- `stats` is exported as a `UnitStats` resource with a setter.\n- On `_set_stats`: duplicates the resource, sets `collision_layer = stats.team + 1`.\n- **Notable**: No `detect_range` or `target_finder` `@onready` variables yet.\n\n---\n\n### `/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn`\n```gdscript\n[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3]\n\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd\" id=\"1_battle_unit\"]\n[ext_resource type=\"Resource\" path=\"res://data/units/bjorn.tres\" id=\"2_stats\"]\n\n[sub_resource type=\"RectangleShape2D\" id=\"1_body_shape\"]\nsize = Vector2(24, 24)\n\n[node name=\"BattleUnit\" type=\"Area2D\"]\ncollision_mask = 0\nscript = ExtResource(\"1_battle_unit\")\nstats = ExtResource(\"2_stats\")\n\n[node name=\"CollisionShape2D\" type=\"CollisionShape2D\" parent=\".\"]\nshape = SubResource(\"1_body_shape\")\n```\n\nKey takeaways:\n- Root node: `Area2D` named \"BattleUnit\" with script `battle_unit.gd`.\n- Default stats resource: `bjorn.tres`.\n- Body shape: `RectangleShape2D` of 24x24.\n- `collision_mask = 0`.\n- **Notable**: No `DetectRange` child or `TargetFinder` child yet.\n\n---\n\n### `/workspace/scenes/main.tscn`\n```gdscript\n[gd_scene load_steps=4 format=3]\n\n[ext_resource type=\"PackedScene\" path=\"res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn\" id=\"1_battle_unit\"]\n[ext_resource type=\"Resource\" path=\"res://data/units/bjorn.tres\" id=\"2_player_stats\"]\n[ext_resource type=\"Resource\" path=\"res://data/enemies/zombie.tres\" id=\"3_enemy_stats\"]\n\n[node name=\"Main\" type=\"Node2D\"]\n\n[node name=\"PlayerUnit\" parent=\".\" groups=[\"player_units\"] instance=ExtResource(\"1_battle_unit\")]\nposition = Vector2(0, 0)\nstats = ExtResource(\"2_player_stats\")\n\n[node name=\"EnemyUnitNear\" parent=\".\" groups=[\"enemy_units\"] instance=ExtResource(\"1_battle_unit\")]\nposition = Vector2(50, 0)\nstats = ExtResource(\"3_enemy_stats\")\n\n[node name=\"EnemyUnitFar\" parent=\".\" groups=[\"enemy_units\"] instance=ExtResource(\"1_battle_unit\")]\nposition = Vector2(130, 0)\nstats = ExtResource(\"3_enemy_stats\")\n```\n\nKey takeaways:\n- Root node: `Node2D` named \"Main\".\n- Three `BattleUnit` instances:\n  - **PlayerUnit** at `(0, 0)`, group `player_units`, stats from `bjorn.tres` (Team.PLAYER, attack_range=2).\n  - **EnemyUnitNear** at `(50, 0)`, group `enemy_units`, stats from `zombie.tres` (Team.ENEMY, attack_range=1).\n  - **EnemyUnitFar** at `(130, 0)`, group `enemy_units`, stats from `zombie.tres` (Team.ENEMY, attack_range=1).\n\n---\n\n### `/workspace/data/units/bjorn.tres` -- Player unit resource\n```gdscript\n[gd_resource type=\"Resource\" script_class=\"UnitStats\" load_steps=2 format=3]\n\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://data/units/unit_stats.gd\" id=\"1_unit_stats\"]\n\n[resource]\nscript = ExtResource(\"1_unit_stats\")\nteam = 0\nattack_range = 2\n```\n\n- **team = 0** (PLAYER), **attack_range = 2**.\n\n---\n\n### `/workspace/data/enemies/zombie.tres` -- Enemy unit resource\n```gdscript\n[gd_resource type=\"Resource\" script_class=\"UnitStats\" load_steps=2 format=3]\n\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://data/units/unit_stats.gd\" id=\"1_unit_stats\"]\n\n[resource]\nscript = ExtResource(\"1_unit_stats\")\nteam = 1\nattack_range = 1\n```\n\n- **team = 1** (ENEMY), **attack_range = 1**.\n\n---\n\n### `/workspace/task_config.json` -- Task instructions\n```json\n{\n  \"instruction\": \"Implement the autobattler combat-targeting setup from the tutorial. In `res://data/units/unit_stats.gd`, define `TARGET = { Team.PLAYER: \\\"enemy_units\\\", Team.ENEMY: \\\"player_units\\\" }` so units can look up the opposing group name from their team. Create `res://custom_nodes/detect_range.gd` as `class_name DetectRange` extending `Area2D` with exported `col_shape: CollisionShape2D`, `base_range_size: float`, and `stats: UnitStats`; when `stats` is assigned, set `collision_layer` to `4 * (stats.team + 1)`, set `collision_mask` to `2 - stats.team`, and replace the collision shape with a `CircleShape2D` whose radius is `base_range_size * stats.attack_range`. Create `res://custom_nodes/target_finder.gd` as `class_name TargetFinder` extending `Node` with an exported `actor: BattleUnit`, a `target: BattleUnit`, a `targets_in_range: Array[BattleUnit]`, and a `targets_in_range_changed` signal. On ready, connect the actor's `DetectRange.area_entered` and `area_exited` signals to handlers that append or erase only `BattleUnit` instances and emit `targets_in_range_changed`. Implement `find_target()` so it uses `UnitStats.TARGET`, `get_nodes_in_group()`, and `distance_squared_to()` to store the closest opposing `BattleUnit` in `target`, and implement `has_target_in_range()` to return whether `targets_in_range` is non-empty. In `res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn`, add a `DetectRange` Area2D child with a `CollisionShape2D` child and a sibling `TargetFinder` node, wire both to the battle unit, and in `res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd` expose them as `detect_range` and `target_finder` onready variables while assigning `detect_range.stats = stats` when battle-unit stats are set.\"\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### `/workspace/custom_nodes/` -- UID files only (no actual `.gd` scripts yet, just `.uid` stubs)\n\n- **`/workspace/custom_nodes/detect_range.gd.uid`**: `uid://dkp51jvetf0st`\n- **`/workspace/custom_nodes/target_finder.gd.uid`**: `uid://bxqx00v4123v3`\n\nThe actual `.gd` scripts for `detect_range.gd` and `target_finder.gd` do **not** exist yet. Only their `.uid` registration stubs exist.\n\n---\n\n### `/workspace/scripts/` -- Empty directory\n\nThis folder exists but contains no files.\n\n---\n\n### `.godot/` cache files\n\n- **`global_script_class_cache.cfg`**: Registers two classes -- `BattleUnit` (base `Area2D`) and `UnitStats` (base `Resource`). No `DetectRange` or `TargetFinder` registered yet.\n- **`scene_groups_cache.cfg`**: Groups `player_units` and `enemy_units` from `main.tscn`.\n- **`editor/project_metadata.cfg`**: Godot executable at `/run/gamedevbench-bin/godot`, recent scene `main.tscn`.\n- **`uid_cache.bin`**: Binary, unreadable.\n\n---\n\n## Summary of What Exists vs. What Is Missing (per the task)\n\n| Component | Status |\n|-----------|--------|\n| `UnitStats` class (`unit_stats.gd`) | **Exists** -- has `Team` enum, `MAX_ATTACK_RANGE`, `team`, `attack_range` |\n| `TARGET` dict in `UnitStats` | **MISSING** -- not yet added |\n| `BattleUnit` class (`battle_unit.gd`) | **Exists** -- has `stats` setter, sets `collision_layer` |\n| `@onready detect_range` / `target_finder` in `BattleUnit` | **MISSING** |\n| `battle_unit.tscn` with `DetectRange` child and `TargetFinder` sibling | **MISSING** -- tscn only has `CollisionShape2D` child |\n| `detect_range.gd` script | **MISSING** -- only `.uid` stub exists |\n| `target_finder.gd` script | **MISSING** -- only `.uid` stub exists |\n| `bjorn.tres` (player resource) | **Exists** -- team=0, attack_range=2 |\n| `zombie.tres` (enemy resource) | **Exists** -- team=1, attack_range=1 |\n| `main.tscn` with 3 units | **Exists** -- PlayerUnit, EnemyUnitNear, EnemyUnitFar |\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_f219cbda4ffeEheE6eTWJKLcmg","sessionId":"ses_f219c605effe9Pb1K80JAxd1ET","model":{"modelID":"deepseek-v4-pro","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Explore project structure","time":{"start":1790437466021,"end":1790437605672}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_6c4e6aa9-d4c6-4ad8-a4d4-b3ae116791a2"}},"id":"prt_0de639f97001V4whgMrUvVaGm3","sessionID":"ses_f219cbda4ffeEheE6eTWJKLcmg","messageID":"msg_0de6344d7001o257HBHcPJNuT0"}}
